<h2>Advanced Mode</h2>

<p>
    Advanced mode provides additional control and visibility:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Inspect extracted text</strong> – View the raw text extracted from the PDF</li>
    <li><strong>Review field extraction</strong> – See what fields were identified and extracted</li>
    <li><strong>Manual adjustments</strong> – Make corrections or adjustments to extracted data</li>
    <li><strong>Debug issues</strong> – Troubleshoot problems with extraction or field mapping</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>When to use Advanced mode:</strong>
</p>
<ul>
    <li>When extraction isn't working as expected</li>
    <li>When you need to verify what data was extracted</li>
    <li>When you want more control over the transfer process</li>
    <li>When troubleshooting form transfer issues</li>
</ul>

<!-- IMAGE PLACEHOLDER: Screenshot of Advanced mode showing: extracted text panel, field extraction results, and manual editing options. Show the toggle to enable Advanced mode. -->

<h2>The Transfer Process</h2>

<p>
    The transfer happens in several stages:
</p>

<h3>Stage 1: Text Extraction</h3>
<ul>
    <li>PDF is processed to extract all text</li>
    <li>Text is saved for field extraction</li>
    <li>Progress: "Extracting text from PDF..."</li>
</ul>

<h3>Stage 2: Field Extraction</h3>
<ul>
    <li>AI analyzes the extracted text</li>
    <li>Identifies form fields and their values</li>
    <li>Maps fields to the target form template</li>
    <li>Progress: "Extracting fields with AI..."</li>
</ul>

<h3>Stage 3: Form Filling</h3>
<ul>
    <li>New form template is populated with extracted data</li>
    <li>Fields are filled accurately based on mapping</li>
    <li>Form is validated and finalized</li>
    <li>Progress: "Filling PDF and attaching..."</li>
</ul>

<h3>Stage 4: Completion</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Completed form is attached to the client record</li>
    <li>Ready to download, send, or sign</li>
    <li>Progress: "Done!"</li>
</ul>

