<h2>Managing Uploaded Files</h2>

<p>
    You can manage files directly in the upload areas:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Remove files</strong> – Click the remove/delete icon to remove an uploaded file</li>
    <li><strong>Replace files</strong> – Upload a new file to replace the current one</li>
    <li><strong>Drag and drop</strong> – Easily add files by dragging them into the upload zone</li>
    <li><strong>File validation</strong> – System checks that files are valid PDFs</li>
</ul>

<p>
    If you upload the wrong file, simply remove it and upload the correct one before clicking "Create New Form".
</p>

