<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Use clear, readable PDFs</strong> – Ensure the old form is a clear, high-quality PDF for best extraction results</li>
    <li><strong>Select the correct form type</strong> – Choose the right target form for accurate field mapping</li>
    <li><strong>Review the output</strong> – Always check the completed form to ensure all fields were filled correctly</li>
    <li><strong>Update business details when needed</strong> – Use the "Update Business Details" option when information has changed</li>
    <li><strong>Use Advanced mode for troubleshooting</strong> – Enable Advanced mode if extraction isn't working as expected</li>
    <li><strong>Keep original forms</strong> – Save the original forms as attachments for reference</li>
</ul>

<!-- IMAGE PLACEHOLDER: Visual checklist showing best practices with icons: quality icon, review icon, update icon, troubleshooting icon. -->

<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

<h3>Extraction Not Working</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure the PDF is clear and not corrupted</li>
    <li>Check that the PDF is not password-protected</li>
    <li>Verify document intelligence integration is configured (Azure or LLMWhisperer)</li>
    <li>Try using Advanced mode to see what text was extracted</li>
    <li>Ensure the form type is correct for the document</li>
</ul>

<h3>Fields Not Filling Correctly</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Review the extracted text in Advanced mode to see what was read</li>
    <li>Check that the form type matches the target form format</li>
    <li>Verify that the old form has the data you're trying to transfer</li>
    <li>Some fields may require manual entry if they're not clearly readable</li>
</ul>

<h3>Form Type Detection Failing</h3>
<ul>
    <li>If Autodetect doesn't work, manually select the correct form type</li>
    <li>Check that the form type is supported</li>
    <li>Verify the uploaded document is actually a supplemental application</li>
</ul>

<h3>Business Details Not Updating</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure "Update Business Details" is checked</li>
    <li>Verify the form contains business information to extract</li>
    <li>Check that you have permission to update client records</li>
    <li>Review the extracted data in Advanced mode to see what was found</li>
</ul>

