<h2>When to Use This Utility</h2>

<p>
    The Supplemental App Transfer is particularly useful when:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Renewing policies</strong> – Transferring data from old supplemental apps to new renewal forms</li>
    <li><strong>Switching carriers</strong> – Moving information to a new carrier's form format</li>
    <li><strong>Updating applications</strong> – Refreshing forms with current information from previous versions</li>
    <li><strong>Standardizing formats</strong> – Converting forms to a standard format</li>
    <li><strong>Saving time</strong> – Avoiding manual data entry for repetitive form filling</li>
</ul>

